%%{init: {'theme':'neutral','flowchart':{'nodeSpacing':25,'rankSpacing':40}}}%%
flowchart TB
  S((Start)) --> OPEN[Open application]
  OPEN --> REG{Registered?}
  REG -->|No| SIGNUP[Register / sign in<br/>Complete profile<br/>Optional diagnosis document<br/>or self-reflection questionnaire]
  SIGNUP --> OPEN
  REG -->|Yes| PERM[Grant camera permission]
  PERM --> CAL[Camera setup:<br/>face + both irises detected]
  CAL --> STABLE{15 consecutive<br/>stable frames?}
  STABLE -->|No| CAL
  STABLE -->|Yes| BASE[Baseline head orientation captured]
  BASE --> SHUF[Randomize category order<br/>from valid stimulus dataset]
  SHUF --> NEXT{Category<br/>available?}
  NEXT -->|No| EXH[Session exhausted —<br/>end gracefully with<br/>whatever was measured]
  NEXT -->|Yes| PLAY[Play curated clip<br/>per-clip duration cap]
  PLAY --> TRACK[Track attention on-device:<br/>gaze deflection + head pose per frame<br/>screen-attention %, gaze shifts,<br/>blinks, first sustained lapse]
  TRACK --> OUTCOME{Outcome}
  OUTCOME -->|Sustained attention drop| SHIFT[Clip ends early<br/>Category marked unsuccessful]
  SHIFT --> NEXT
  OUTCOME -->|User skips| SKIPN{Second skip of<br/>this category?}
  SKIPN -->|No| REQ[Requeue category<br/>to end of order]
  REQ --> NEXT
  SKIPN -->|Yes| RET[Retire category<br/>record as skipped]
  RET --> NEXT
  OUTCOME -->|Clip completes,<br/>attention maintained| RATE[Post-clip self-ratings:<br/>interest 1–5, focus 1–5]
  RATE --> SUCC[Successful assessment +1]
  SUCC --> FIVE{5 successful?}
  FIVE -->|No| NEXT
  FIVE -->|Yes| SCORE[Compute per-category<br/>attention score 0–100]
  EXH --> SCORE
  SCORE --> RANK[Rank categories]
  RANK --> TRAIT[Aggregate trait clusters<br/>of strongest categories]
  TRAIT --> LS[Infer learning style]
  LS --> REC[Generate study techniques,<br/>content formats, weekly goals]
  REC --> SAVE[(Save derived metrics<br/>locally — Room)]
  SAVE --> SHOW[Show results, learning style,<br/>recommendations, progress]
  SHOW --> CHOICE{Next}
  CHOICE -->|Export| PDF[Generate PDF report<br/>download or email]
  CHOICE -->|New session| SHUF
  CHOICE -->|Done| E(((End)))
  PDF --> E

  classDef term fill:#dbe5f1,stroke:#1f497d
  classDef bad fill:#fde9d9,stroke:#c0504d
  class SHIFT,RET,EXH bad
